### 실제 Trade PC 주소로 수정. stub은 상품 번호 == 채팅방 번호, 판매자 100, 구매자 3.
@tradeUrl = http://localhost:8083
@sellerId = 100
@buyerId = 3
@productId = 7
@chatRoomId = 7
@requestKey = integration-flow-001

### 판매자 결제 요청 → 201 PAYMENT_REQUESTED (같은 키 재시도는 200)
POST {{tradeUrl}}/trades
Content-Type: application/json
X-Member-Id: {{sellerId}}
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}

{"productId":{{productId}},"buyerId":{{buyerId}},"chatRoomId":{{chatRoomId}}}

> {% client.global.set("tradeId", response.body.tradeId); %}

### 채팅방 거래 조회
GET {{tradeUrl}}/trades?chatRoomId={{chatRoomId}}
X-Member-Id: {{buyerId}}

### 구매자 모의 결제 → PAID (반복해도 중복 송금 없음)
POST {{tradeUrl}}/trades/{{tradeId}}/pay
X-Member-Id: {{buyerId}}

### 구매 확정 → COMPLETED / Market SOLD
POST {{tradeUrl}}/trades/{{tradeId}}/complete
X-Member-Id: {{buyerId}}

### 취소는 별도 상품으로 구매 확정 전 실행. PAID이면 환불, COMPLETED이면 409
POST {{tradeUrl}}/trades/{{tradeId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-Member-Id: {{sellerId}}

{"reason":"일정이 맞지 않아요"}
